& [IR1ScaffoldExecutionPlanAndPlaceholderScopeV1] is the IR1-S05 plan for scaffold execution and placeholder scope
  + [plan_id] is ir1-scaffold-execution-plan-placeholder-scope-v1
  + [plan_uuid] is 161b6641-8ae6-4ae1-95b6-95b8e7c42ebd
  + [slice_id] is IR1-S05
  + [plan_status] is accepted_by_completion_review_pending
  + [model_route] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable
  + [model_route_used] is current Codex manager session because no separate Spark worker was active
  + [implementation_scope] is scaffold plan only

  = must: define a bounded scaffold file inventory and placeholder scope for later activation
  = must: remain a plan-only artifact until IR1-S06 accepts the scaffold activation pack
  = must: preserve that scaffold files are inert placeholders and cannot implement parser, SQLite, LangGraph, surface, adapter, operations simulator, operations control, or live machine control behavior

& [ScaffoldFileInventory] is the file inventory that IR1-S06 may activate for scaffold creation
  + [planned_file] is pyproject.toml
  + [planned_file_role] is PEP 621 project metadata and future tool configuration holder
  + [planned_file] is src/langsop/__init__.py
  + [planned_file_role] is inert package marker with version placeholder only
  + [planned_file] is src/langsop/authority/__init__.py
  + [planned_file_role] is inert authority module marker
  + [planned_file] is src/langsop/kernel/__init__.py
  + [planned_file_role] is inert kernel module marker
  + [planned_file] is src/langsop/projections/__init__.py
  + [planned_file_role] is inert projections module marker
  + [planned_file] is src/langsop/operators/__init__.py
  + [planned_file_role] is inert operators module marker
  + [planned_file] is src/langsop/runtime/__init__.py
  + [planned_file_role] is inert runtime module marker
  + [planned_file] is src/langsop/surfaces/__init__.py
  + [planned_file_role] is inert surfaces module marker
  + [planned_file] is src/langsop/coordination/__init__.py
  + [planned_file_role] is inert coordination module marker
  + [planned_file] is src/langsop/operations/__init__.py
  + [planned_file_role] is inert operations module marker that explicitly states dry-run-only future scope
  + [planned_file] is tests/test_scaffold_imports.py
  + [planned_file_role] is no-op import smoke test for inert package markers
  + [planned_file] is .gitignore
  + [planned_file_role] is generated artifact exclusion update

  = must: treat this inventory as the maximum scaffold file set until IR1-S06 acceptance
  = must: require a new review before adding files outside this inventory

& [PlaceholderModuleBoundary] is the behavioral boundary for planned placeholder modules
  + [allowed_placeholder_content] is module docstring
  + [allowed_placeholder_content] is __all__ empty tuple or list
  + [allowed_placeholder_content] is package version placeholder in src/langsop/__init__.py
  + [allowed_placeholder_content] is comment pointing to accepted SOP authority
  + [forbidden_placeholder_content] is file system traversal
  + [forbidden_placeholder_content] is subprocess usage
  + [forbidden_placeholder_content] is network usage
  + [forbidden_placeholder_content] is credential or environment secret access
  + [forbidden_placeholder_content] is SQLite connection creation
  + [forbidden_placeholder_content] is LangGraph import or graph construction
  + [forbidden_placeholder_content] is parser behavior
  + [forbidden_placeholder_content] is adapter behavior
  + [forbidden_placeholder_content] is operations simulation
  + [forbidden_placeholder_content] is process, GPU, model runtime, or job control

  = must: make placeholders importable without side effects
  = must: fail scaffold review if any placeholder performs behavior beyond inert module marking

& [PackageMetadataPlan] is the package metadata plan for pyproject.toml
  + [project_name] is langsop
  + [requires_python] is >=3.12
  + [dependency_set] is empty_initial_runtime_dependencies
  + [optional_dependency_group] is dev may later include pytest after dependency review
  + [build_backend_candidate] is setuptools.build_meta or hatchling pending scaffold activation review
  + [script_entry_point] is none_initially
  + [tool_config_allowed] is minimal pytest path configuration only after IR1-S06 acceptance

  = must: avoid external dependencies in the first scaffold unless IR1-S06 explicitly accepts them
  = must: avoid console scripts until a later slice authorizes CLI behavior

& [NoOpTestPlan] is the no-op test plan for scaffold smoke testing
  + [test_file] is tests/test_scaffold_imports.py
  + [test_case] is import langsop package
  + [test_case] is import inert marker modules
  + [test_case] is assert no generated artifact path is created by imports
  + [test_case] is assert operations module exposes no live-control function
  + [forbidden_test_behavior] is parsing SOP files
  + [forbidden_test_behavior] is building SQLite projections
  + [forbidden_test_behavior] is running LangGraph
  + [forbidden_test_behavior] is opening network connections
  + [forbidden_test_behavior] is accessing credentials
  + [forbidden_test_behavior] is launching processes or jobs

  = must: keep smoke tests side-effect-free

& [GeneratedArtifactExclusionPlan] is the generated artifact exclusion plan for .gitignore
  + [ignore_entry] is .venv/
  + [ignore_entry] is .langsop/
  + [ignore_entry] is .pytest_cache/
  + [ignore_entry] is .coverage
  + [ignore_entry] is htmlcov/
  + [ignore_entry] is dist/
  + [ignore_entry] is build/
  + [ignore_entry] is *.egg-info/
  + [ignore_entry] is __pycache__/
  + [ignore_entry] is *.pyc

  = must: preserve docs/ and tests/fixtures/expected/ as tracked source or expected-output ledgers
  = must: keep generated artifacts ignored unless a future source-preserving record explicitly authorizes tracking

& [ScaffoldOnlyProofChecklist] is the proof checklist for later scaffold activation
  + [proof_check] is scaffold inventory matches accepted plan
  + [proof_check] is pyproject contains no unreviewed runtime dependencies
  + [proof_check] is placeholders import without side effects
  + [proof_check] is tests are no-op smoke tests only
  + [proof_check] is .gitignore excludes generated projection artifacts
  + [proof_check] is no parser behavior present
  + [proof_check] is no SQLite builder behavior present
  + [proof_check] is no LangGraph behavior present
  + [proof_check] is no surface or adapter behavior present
  + [proof_check] is no operations simulator behavior present
  + [proof_check] is no operations control or live machine control present

  = must: use this checklist in IR1-S06 before scaffold authority is activated

